    "title": "Magic Piano Rush - Music Star",
    "description": "About this game\uff1a\r\n\r\nFeel the music on piano tiles. Enjoy the beats and become a piano master!\r\n\ud83c\udfb6 Are you ready to experience the delightful music in PERFECT PIANO now!\r\n\r\n\u2728 How to play \u2728\r\nSimple and easy to get started. Follow the music, tap the tiles to catch the beat. \r\nTips for higher scores: Try to get higher combos. \ud83c\udfb9\r\n\r\n\u2728 Game Feature \u2728\r\n- Real music feeling while tapping the tiles.\r\n- Unique journey with high-quality songs of various styles.\r\n- Different difficulties for everyone. \r\n- Cool design and attractive tiles.\r\n- Easy to play, hard to master.\r\n\r\nNow don\u2019t miss this PERFECT Piano games!  This excellent piano game is more interesting for you than you can imagine!\r\n\r\nIf any producer or label has an issue with any of the music used in the game, please send email to us and it will be deleted immediately if necessary (this includes the images used).\r\n\r\nTerms of Service: https://sites.google.com/view/perfect-piano-tos\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/perfect-piano",
